## Plain-Language Clarification (Non-Authoritative)

This summary is provided for convenience and does not replace the official PolyForm Noncommercial text.

- The noncommercial restriction is not limited to resale or redistribution.
- Internal use by for-profit organizations for business purposes is generally considered commercial use.
- If your organization is for-profit and wants to use this project in business operations, request a separate commercial agreement.

For binding terms, always refer to the canonical and official license text linked above.
